# Cloudflare Pages redirect map for the isculptures.com.au cutover.
#
# Built from the ten historical sitemaps in the Shopify files export, so every
# URL that has ever been indexed is accounted for. First match wins, so the
# specific rules must stay above the wildcards.
#
# The split is by SEARCH INTENT, not by URL shape. The old catalogue ranks for
# retail queries ("saint charbel statue", "orthodox icon"). That traffic wants
# to buy one thing, and now converts on Etsy — sending it to a B2B enquiry form
# would just raise the bounce rate. Only the volume/enquiry URLs come across.

# --- Bulk, events and wholesale: the pages that match the new positioning ---
/pages/events-custom-gifts   /#events    301
/pages/events-custom         /#events    301
/pages/bonbonniere-custom    /#events    301
/products/wholesale          /#project   301
/products/bonbonniere-gifts  /#events    301
/products/bonbonnieres-gifts /#events    301

# --- Contact and company pages ---
/pages/contact               /#project   301
/contact-us/                 /#project   301
/about-us/                   /#about     301
/faq/                        /#project   301
/blog/                       /           301

# --- Policies: repoint once the new policy pages exist. ---
# TODO: replace these with real /policies/* pages before cutover; sending legal
# pages to the homepage is acceptable only as a stopgap.
/policies/privacy-policy     /           302
/policies/refund-policy      /           302
/policies/shipping-policy    /           302
/policies/terms-of-service   /           302
/privacy-policy/             /           302
/terms-and-conditions/       /           302

