# --- Retired for good: served 410 by Pages Functions, not redirected. ---
# Five URLs with no Etsy equivalent AND no photography to relist from are
# handled in functions/ instead. They need no rule here, and could not have one:
# `_redirects` supports 301/302/303/307/308 only, and redirects are not applied
# to requests a Function serves — which is what lets them escape the
# /products/* catch-all below. See docs/etsy-relisting.md.

# Catch-alls last: anything not named above.
/products/*     https://www.etsy.com/au/shop/iSculptures 301
/collections/*  https://www.etsy.com/au/shop/iSculptures 301
/collections    https://www.etsy.com/au/shop/iSculptures 301
